OL,3,ATwo charged with national security
OL,4,Aoffences over RAF Fairford incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo British nationals have been charged
OL,7,Fwith national security offences over an
OL,8,Fincident at RAF Fairford, with one
OL,9,Fsuspected of assisting Iran's
OL,10,Fintelligence service.
OL,12,FMohmed Ahmad Abdulkarim, 24, has been
OL,13,Fcharged with assisting a foreign
OL,14,Fintelligence service following the
OL,15,Fincident near the airbase in
OL,16,FGloucestershire in September.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
