OL,3,ATwo charged with national security
OL,4,Aoffences over RAF Fairford incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FNouman Essghir, also 24, has been
OL,7,Fcharged with entering a prohibited
OL,8,Fplace for a purpose prejudicial to the
OL,9,FUK on 22 August. Both men will appear
OL,10,Fat Westminster Magistrates' Court
OL,11,Flater.
OL,13,FThree suspicious vans were seen near
OL,14,Fthe US-operated airbase on 27
OL,15,FSeptember.
